                        <div class="anthem-progress-track">
                            <div class="anthem-progress-fill" id="anthemProgressFill"></div>
                        </div>
                        <span class="anthem-waveform-time" id="anthemTimeDuration">5:07</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="anthem-footer">
                <button class="anthem-lyrics-toggle" id="anthemLyricsToggle">
                    <span class="anthem-lyrics-toggle-text" id="anthemLyricsToggleText">View Lyrics</span>
                    <svg class="anthem-lyrics-chevron" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M4 6l4 4 4-4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                </button>
                <a href="/music/" class="anthem-music-link">
                    Explore All Music
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M6 3l5 5-5 5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="anthem-lyrics-body" id="anthemLyricsBody">
                <div class="anthem-lyrics-scroll">

                    <div class="lyrics-label">[Verse 1]</div>
                    <div class="lyrics-verse">
                        Come, O Source of endless mercy,<br>
                        Loose my tongue to sing Thy grace.<br>
                        Streams of goodness, ever flowing,<br>
                        Fill the hollows in this soul of mine.<br>
                        I have tasted bitter waters,<br>
                        Trying to satisfy the thirst.<br>
                        But the Shepherd's voice spoke clearly—<br>
                        Called this wandering stranger home.
                    </div>

                    <div class="lyrics-label">[Chorus 1 — The Savior's Voice]</div>
                    <div class="lyrics-chorus">
                        Come to Me, all worn and weary.<br>
                        Look to Me, and live.<br>
                        Learn of Me — My grace sustains you.<br>
                        Can you hear Me… calling your name?
                    </div>

                    <div class="lyrics-label">[Verse 2]</div>
                    <div class="lyrics-verse">
                        Now I speak in words of plainness:<br>
                        With Thy help this far I've come.<br>
                        I hope by Thy tender mercy<br>
                        Safely to return back home.<br>
                        Far from Thee and full of questions,<br>
                        I knelt down and poured out my soul.<br>
                        He healed every empty place in me,<br>
                        Made my broken vessel whole.
                    </div>

                    <div class="lyrics-label">[Chorus 2 — The Savior Draws Near]</div>
                    <div class="lyrics-chorus">
                        My arms are open.<br>
                        My wounded heart still beats for you.<br>
                        My hands will bless you.<br>
                        The marks of your worth remain on Me.
                    </div>

                    <div class="lyrics-label">[Verse 3]</div>
                    <div class="lyrics-verse">
                        By Thy goodness, I was found.<br>
                        Now I bear a joyful debt to carry!<br>
                        To Thy grace I am now bound.<br>
                        Turn now my wandering heart to Thee:<br>
                        Prone to wander, Lord, I feel it,<br>
                        Prone to leave the path You've shown;<br>
                        Here's my soul — O take and seal it,<br>
                        Bring me to my heavenly home.
                    </div>

                    <div class="lyrics-label">[Chorus 3 — The Savior Claims]</div>
                    <div class="lyrics-chorus">
                        Take My name upon you.<br>
                        The marks of your worth remain on Me.<br>
                        You are no stranger now—<br>
                        I call you by name.
                    </div>

                    <div class="lyrics-label">[Finale]</div>
                    <div class="lyrics-chorus">
                        Bring my heavenly home to me,<br>
                        And bring me to my heavenly home.
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
